From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Agent <claude-agent@invalid>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:53:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wayland/color-management: Post the creator's own
 unsupported_feature error

set_mastering_display_primaries and set_mastering_luminance on a
wp_image_description_creator_params_v1 raised
WP_COLOR_MANAGER_V1_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE. Protocol error codes are
scoped to the interface of the object the error is posted on; that
enum belongs to wp_color_manager_v1 and has the value 0, which on the
creator-params interface means incomplete_set. Clients were told they
had sent an incomplete parameter set.

Post WP_IMAGE_DESCRIPTION_CREATOR_PARAMS_V1_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE
(2), the creator-params interface's own code for an unsupported request.
---
 src/wayland/meta-wayland-color-management.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/wayland/meta-wayland-color-management.c b/src/wayland/meta-wayland-color-management.c
index 6029c78..ac20f44 100644
--- a/src/wayland/meta-wayland-color-management.c
+++ b/src/wayland/meta-wayland-color-management.c
@@ -1805,7 +1805,7 @@ creator_params_set_mastering_display_primaries (struct wl_client   *client,
                                                 int32_t             w_y)
 {
   wl_resource_post_error (resource,
-                          WP_COLOR_MANAGER_V1_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE,
+                          WP_IMAGE_DESCRIPTION_CREATOR_PARAMS_V1_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE,
                           "Setting mastering display primaries is not supported");
 }
 
@@ -1816,7 +1816,7 @@ creator_params_set_mastering_luminance (struct wl_client   *client,
                                         uint32_t            max_lum)
 {
   wl_resource_post_error (resource,
-                          WP_COLOR_MANAGER_V1_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE,
+                          WP_IMAGE_DESCRIPTION_CREATOR_PARAMS_V1_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE,
                           "Setting mastering display luminances is not supported");
 }
 
